# Make Pantera's palette the default theme.
#
# Chromium's default theme is Google's hard-coded palette: a blue primary and
# slightly tinted grays. Pantera's (DECISION-8, devbacklog TASK-22) uses
# Pantera's amber (#F2A516) as the primary color, at the seed's own chroma,
# over zero-chroma grays, and darkens dark mode to charcoal. It replaces the
# baseline palette, so it's the "Default" theme in the color picker and what
# new profiles get; other picker colors are unchanged.

